export anchor BakeryBoxStyle:
    number: 83
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Bakery box
    idea: The dashboard is a pink pastry box tied with striped tape, with projects sitting in its compartments as round cakes that fill like a pie, numbers hanging on cake tags from twine and every status on a notched tag.
    base: light
    palette:
        shop: #fff6f2, the page
        boxPink: #f9dfe6, the lid band and the box
        deepPink: #f2bccb, tag lips, dotted rules and last week bars
        tape: #e2789a, diagonal stripes with white on tape bands, decoration only
        cream: #fffaf6, compartments, tags and panels
        cocoa: #3b1f2b, text and 2 to 3px outlines
        milkCocoa: #6a4553, secondary text
        raspberry: #a3224d, the primary button, cake fill, this week bars, the overdue tag and focus
        mint: #2c6a4d, the On track tag
        caramel: #7b4a00, the At risk tag
        cherry: #a11c1c, the Behind tag
        twine: #b08a6e, the dashed string, decoration only
    type:
        Script headings use Snell Roundhand, Segoe Script, Lucida
        Handwriting, Brush Script MT at weight 400, the greeting 50px, box
        and panel titles 32 to 38px and the brand 30px. Everything else uses
        Avenir Next Rounded, Nunito, Varela Round, Arial Rounded MT Bold,
        Trebuchet MS, hanging tag figures 44px at 800, project names 18px at
        800, tags 13px at 800, body 14 to 16px and labels 11px bold caps
        tracked 0.16em.
    layout:
        A pink lid band starts with a striped tape strip and holds an oval
        cream seal with Brightwork in raspberry script and a dashed pink
        inner line, nav as cream pills with Home in raspberry, a round
        search, a raspberry New project pill, a round bell with a 3 and a
        dashed avatar ring for Mara Okafor. The greeting sits beside a large
        tilted cake tag reading 4 tasks are overdue. A dashed twine curve
        crosses the page with four tags hanging from it, each with a punched
        hole, a slight tilt and a pink lip, for the summary numbers. The
        projects sit in a pink box with a 3px outline and a striped tape
        band down its middle, under the script title Today’s box of six, as
        six cream compartments, each with a round cake whose raspberry
        slice is the percent and a cream pill with the figure, the name,
        team and tasks, Ready and the due date, and a status tag. Below
        sit Out of the oven, a bar chart of cupcake bars with round tops,
        pale pink last week and raspberry this week, and an Order slip with
        a piece of tape on its corner. At 375px compartments stack and the
        tags go two by two.
    spacing: An 8px unit, soft. 14px between compartments and 22px box padding.
    density: Low to medium. Six compartments with one cake each.
    corners: Very round. 22px panels, 16px compartments, pill buttons and notched tags.
    borders: 2 to 3px cocoa outlines everywhere, with striped tape bands across the lid, the box and the style sheet.
    shadows: Flat coloured lips only, 3 to 6px of pink or deep raspberry under tags and buttons.
    icons:
        Pie cakes for progress and hanging tags for numbers. Status tags
        have a notched end and a punched hole and pair the word with a disc
        tick for On track, a triangle for At risk and a crossed square for
        Behind.
    focus: A 3px raspberry outline offset 3px with a 7px pale pink halo.
    tone: A sweet shopkeeper, such as fresh from the oven, Today’s box of six, Out of the oven, Order slip and Ready 14 Nov.
